"(e.g., ``virtSwitch0 already exists on this host and will be reused``)"
msgstr ""
"**Management virtSwitch** — Affiche le virtSwitch de gestion détecté (par "
"ex., ``virtSwitch0 already exists on this host and will be reused``)"

